{"id":"sredstvo","lemma":"средство","pos":"noun","rank":1935,"glosses":["means, facility","tool, instrument, equipment","remedy, drug"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/Ru-%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"средства","plural":"средства"},"examples":[{"text":"Телефон - это средство связи.","en":"The telephone is a means of communication.","words":[{"g":"telephone"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"tie","l":"связь"}]},{"text":"Мы исчерпали наши средства.","en":"We exhausted our funds.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728258","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null]},{"text":"Есть ли средство?","en":"Is there a remedy?","words":[{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"whether (question)"},null]},{"text":"Мы должны использовать все средства, чтобы его убедить.","en":"We have to use every means to persuade him.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to use, to apply"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},null,{"g":"that...should"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"to convince"}]},{"text":"Цель не всегда оправдывает средства.","en":"The end does not always justify the means.","words":[{"g":"goal"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"always"},null,null]}]}